# AIScholarHub Maintenance & Operations Guide

This quick reference guide outlines standard maintenance workflows, container management commands, database user management, and troubleshooting steps for the **AIScholarHub** and **Admin Panel** infrastructure.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

- **Main Platform:** `https://aischolarhub.seedsnet.org` (`AI_Scholar_Hub` container, port `3080`)
- **Admin Panel:** `https://admin-ai.seedsnet.org` (`aischolarhub-admin-panel` container, port `3081`)
- **Database:** MongoDB (`chat-mongodb` container, database `LibreChat`)
- **Reverse Proxy:** Apache2 with SSL terminated via Let's Encrypt / Cloudflare Proxy

---

## 🚀 Core Docker Commands

### Container Operations
```bash
# Navigate to project directory
cd /opt/aischolarhub

# Check status of all containers
docker compose ps

# View live logs for specific services
docker logs -f AI_Scholar_Hub            # Main LibreChat API
docker logs -f aischolarhub-admin-panel   # Admin Panel
docker logs -f chat-mongodb               # MongoDB

# Restart or force-recreate services after .env or compose updates
docker compose up -d --force-recreate api admin-panel

# Stop and start full stack
docker compose down
docker compose up -d
```

