## ⚙️ Environment Configuration (`.env`)

Ensure your `.env` contains the following routing definitions for internal service-to-service communication:

```env
# RAG & Vector DB Integration
RAG_PORT=8000
RAG_API_URL=http://rag_api:8000

# Ollama Endpoint (Internal Docker Network)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://ollama:11434
EMBEDDINGS_PROVIDER=ollama
EMBEDDINGS_MODEL=nomic-embed-text

# Vector Storage Connection
VECTOR_DB_TYPE=pgvector # or chromadb
VECTOR_DB_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@vector-db:5432/vectordb

```

