## 🔍 Troubleshooting RAG & Vector Issues

### Embeddings Failing or Timing Out

If file uploads fail during vector processing, verify that the embedding model is loaded in Ollama:

```bash
# Check if Ollama service is reachable from the RAG container
docker exec -it rag_api curl http://ollama:11434/api/tags

```

### Vector DB Connectivity Issues

```bash
# Inspect live logs for the RAG container
docker logs -f rag_api

# Reset/Clear Vector Indexes (if database gets corrupted)
docker exec -it vector-db psql -U postgres -d vectordb -c "DROP TABLE IF EXISTS langchain_pg_embedding;"
